{"id":"mountain_overview","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"mountain_fact","name":"栖霞山概况","content":"栖霞山位于江苏省南京市栖霞区，古称摄山，北临长江，属宁镇山脉西段北支。现有材料记载总面积约825.4公顷。","source_type":"compiled_existing_material","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"medium","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":["面积数字来自现有整理材料，正式对外发布前建议补权威来源链接。"],"tags":["概况","地理"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"mountain_peak","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"mountain_fact","name":"主峰凤翔峰","content":"现有材料称栖霞山主峰为凤翔峰，海拔286米。","source_type":"compiled_existing_material","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"medium","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":["海拔与最高峰表述建议用官方导览牌或权威地理资料复核。"],"tags":["山体","凤翔峰"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"mountain_name_origin","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"history","name":"摄山与栖霞山得名","content":"栖霞山古称摄山。现有材料记载，南齐隐士明僧绍隐居摄山并舍宅为寺，寺名与“栖霞”相关，山随后以寺得名。","source_type":"compiled_existing_material","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"medium","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["明僧绍","山名"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"autumn_qixia_custom","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"culture","name":"秋栖霞","content":"现有材料称明代以来南京有“秋栖霞”的秋游习俗，栖霞山以深秋红叶景观著称。","source_type":"compiled_existing_material","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"medium","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["民俗","红叶"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"qixia_culture_layers","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"culture","name":"栖霞山文化主题","content":"现有知识框架将栖霞山文化概括为六朝、红叶、地质、名人和中医药五类。","source_type":"compiled_existing_material","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"medium","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["文化框架"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"history_timeline","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"history","name":"栖霞山历史时间轴","content":"现有材料整理的主线为：南朝齐建寺与齐梁石窟开凿；隋仁寿元年建舍利塔；唐代形成重要佛教地位并留下明征君碑；南唐重建舍利塔；明清多次重建，乾隆时期修建行宫并多次驻跸。","source_type":"compiled_existing_material","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"medium","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":["栖霞寺始建年份存在489年与498年冲突，时间轴不写死具体始建年份。"],"tags":["历史","时间轴"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"maple_sweetgum_distinction","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"nature_science","name":"枫香与槭树辨识","content":"栖霞山主要色叶树种之一是枫香。现有材料给出的亲子辨识方法为：枫香常见三裂叶、叶序互生；槭树类常见对生叶。实际识别还应结合具体物种，不宜只凭裂片数量下结论。","source_type":"compiled_existing_material","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"medium","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":["“三裂等于枫香、五裂等于真枫”只能作为简化提示，不能替代植物学鉴定。"],"tags":["枫香","槭树","亲子科普"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"autumn_tree_species","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"nature_science","name":"主要色叶树种","content":"现有材料列举的色叶树种包括枫香、鸡爪槭、红枫、羽毛枫、三角枫、乌桕、黄连木和榉树等。不同树种、海拔与坡向的变色时间不同。","source_type":"compiled_existing_material","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"medium","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["红叶","树种"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"forest_fire_rule","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"safety_rule","name":"森林防火与文明游览","content":"栖霞山属于森林景区。游客不应携带火种进入林区，不应在禁烟区域吸烟或使用明火；同时应避免攀折红叶、乱丢垃圾及触摸刻画文物。现场规定优先。","source_type":"compiled_official_requirement","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"secondary_compilation","confidence":"high","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["安全","文明游览"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
{"id":"stone_steps_safety","library_id":"KB01","knowledge_type":"safety_rule","name":"山路防滑提醒","content":"山间台阶、青苔和落叶在潮湿环境下可能造成打滑，建议穿防滑运动鞋或徒步鞋；早晚和山顶有风时携带轻便防风保暖层。","source_type":"general_safety_advice","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"general_safety_advice","confidence":"high","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["防滑","保暖"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27"}
